# Agent skills (always on)

Read and follow the project skills under `.cursor/skills/` (authoritative).

## Precedence

1. **Coding construction** (write, fix, design, refactor, choose dependencies) → [`.cursor/skills/ponytail/SKILL.md`](../skills/ponytail/SKILL.md)
2. **Before claiming done / commit / PR** → [`.cursor/skills/deslop/SKILL.md`](../skills/deslop/SKILL.md) (diff vs `main`)
3. **Same finish gate** → [`.cursor/skills/thermo-nuclear-code-quality-review/SKILL.md`](../skills/thermo-nuclear-code-quality-review/SKILL.md) on the branch diff; fix blockers

Ponytail does **not** own the finish-gate review — that is deslop then thermo-nuclear.

If they conflict: **ponytail** wins on whether to add a thing; **thermo-nuclear** wins on restructuring something already being shipped; **deslop** wins on cosmetic AI noise.
